IMPORTANT NOTE REGARDING GAMMA SOFTWARE:

This repository provides Python scripts and utilities for organizing workflows
with GAMMA software. GAMMA itself is COMMERCIAL SOFTWARE that requires a
separate license from Gamma Remote Sensing AG (https://www.gamma-rs.ch/).

The scripts in this repository are MIT licensed, but using them to process
data with GAMMA requires you to:
1. Obtain a valid GAMMA license
2. Install GAMMA software separately
3. Comply with GAMMA's license terms

This repository does NOT include, distribute, or provide access to GAMMA
software or its source code.
